monkeyspankinggoober@hotmail.com wrote:

> I am not clear on the BUC status of the ring of increase accuracy.  Is
> it blessed merely because it is +1?  Would it be cursed if it was -1? 
> If that is not the case, is there any benefit to it being blessed?

Only the generic benefits (blessed items are harder to curse). The
blessed/cursed status it generates with does give you a clue to the
enchantment; blessed rings are more likely to generate positively
enchanted, and cursed rings are more likely to generate negatively
enchanted. There are no hard rules, though, and blessed -1 rings are
entirely possible.

